  65:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  controller.
  66:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  2. We are running on the E51 and all other cores  are in wfi.
  67:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  3. The MSS PLL will be set to use default internal clock of 80MH
  68:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_nwc_init.c ****      *  4. MSS peripherals including the I/O are in the default power on state
